+## Importing items
+
+Supplier price lists come in as CSV with the columns `sku`, `name`, `category`, `quantity` and `unit_cost` (euros
+with a dot), and optionally `location` and `reorder_level`:
+
+```sh
+python3 -m stockroom.cli import supplier.csv
+```
+
+A new SKU is added (at location `INBOX` when none is given); for a known SKU the name, category and unit cost are
+updated and the quantity is received as stock. Lines with a problem are skipped and listed with their line number;
+the rest is imported and saved.
+
 ## Discount codes
 
 | Code | Off | Minimum subtotal |
